   "content": "<h3>Examination number: ______</h3>\n<h2 id=\"unit1\">Lingadzi Examination Borad</h2>\n<p><strong>2018 – 2019 END OF TERM TWO EXAMINATIONS FOR STANDARD 7</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"unit2\">Bible Knowledge</h2>\n<p>(35 marks)</p>\n<p>Name of candidate: ______ Date: ______</p>\n<h3>Instructions:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Write your name on each paper</li>\n<li>Cheating is not allowed if found you will be penalized</li>\n<li>Write your number on each paper</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Section C: ( 35 Marks)</h3>\n<h2 id=\"unit3\">Bible Knowledge</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Mention any three parables used in Malawian cultures</li>\n</ol>\n<ol>\n<li>______</li>\n<li>______</li>\n<li>______</li>\n</ol>\n<p>6 marks</p>\n<p>b. State two occasions when parables are used</p>\n<p>i. ______</p>\n<p>ii. ______</p>\n<p>4 marks</p>\n<p>c. Write down two judges that you know</p>\n<p>i. ______</p>\n<p>ii.______</p>\n<p>4 marks</p>\n<p>d.Give the name of a judge whose strength was in his hair</p>\n<p>______1 mark</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Who was</li>\n</ol>\n<ol>\n<li>the father of Samson</li>\n</ol>\n<ol>\n<li>whose daughter was vowed to be offered as a sacrifice</li>\n</ol>\n<p>b. explain the following</p>\n<p>i. parable of the lost coin</p>\n<p>ii.good Samaritan</p>\n<p>______ 6 marks</p>\n<ol>\n<li>List down two groups of vulnerable people</li>\n</ol>\n<ol>\n<li><blockquote>\n<p>______\n</blockquote></li>\n<li><blockquote>\n<p>______\n</blockquote></li>\n</ol>\n<p>4 marks</p>\n<p>b. Mention two kings of Israel</p>\n<p>i. ______</p>\n<p>ii. ______</p>\n<p>4 marks</p>\n<p>c.Define the term sacraments</p>\n<h3>End of Question Paper</h3>"
